      "id": "2092513983962243351",
      "text": "Pegasus calls Hasan humanity's biggest hypocrite and the biggest sc*mbag he’s ever seen following the We Are Charlie Kirk rebuttal\n\n\"The irony, he goes what goes around comes around Asmongold. I agree, I agree, karma does exist and it's interesting, Hasan seems to believe in karma. I don't know if he thinks he's way too far gone..he's like I've maxed out my f'in evil meter here so it doesn't even matter anymore\"\n\n\"Also I love how a dog shocking meme is like a level 99 threat, I can't believe u even watched that clip. There's a rule among content creators that u don't watch clips of dog shocking memes, I guess. Meanwhile, Hasan, lol lol he's (Kirk) de*d, lol lol..humanity's biggest hypocrite dude\"\n\n\"It's crazy, I thought I was covering like YouTube streamer drama and I accidentally stumbled across the biggest sc*mbag I've seen in my life..u cannot write a villain this bad\"\n\n(Via moresus on YT)",
