    {
      "id": "2095877089169670221",
      "text": "This was half the chat, at least 🙂\nAnd according to @SoyPill, he had to hide a couple of bad ad homs calling me a Nazi, so it must have been even more unhinged lol\nI do not hold a streamer accountable for every single rancid shot their chat says obviously.\nBut if half of your chat is this...\nThen that's the audience you cultivated.\nAnd upon me questioning this, if your answer is \"it's fiiiine, lol, they love you, nothing crazy about this\" (not a direct quote)...\nThen I can only assume two things:\n1) You don't find this bad and you are fine with having this... Scum... As your community.\n2) You agree with what they say but you pretend like you don't.\nWith 2, it would be a type of scum I would never want to engage with. \nBut I am fairly certain it's 1 for SoyPill, which is, of course, his business entirely how he manages his community and whether they should repent his values at least somewhat.\nBut I also can point out that it's nuts 🙂\nP. S. After I saw him laugh at his mod calling @BoxLoner \"a house n-word\" aka a race traitor because he is an Arab who doesn't support terrorist authoritarian evil fucks like Hezbollah and saying, later, that he would not have an issue with people in his chat calling him a \"house n-word\" as long as they are black (lmao, lmfao even)...\nI have no further questions about his moderation policies or lack there of and I understand that he is operating on some high tier American retard dimension I can't even hope to fathom.\nThat's all I have to say about this \"drama\"",
